adjudication.rationale:
In `sendAddGuestsEmails` (packages/emails/email-manager.ts), the code conditionally sends organizer notifications to `calendarEvent.team.members`:

```ts
if (calendarEvent.team?.members) {
  for (const teamMember of calendarEvent.team.members) {
    ... new OrganizerAddGuestsEmail({ calEvent: calendarEvent, teamMember })
  }
}
```

But in the newly added `addGuestsHandler` (packages/trpc/.../addGuests.handler.ts), the constructed `evt: CalendarEvent` does not set any `team` field at all (it sets `organizer`, `attendees`, `destinationCalendar`, etc., but no `team`). Therefore `calendarEvent.team` will be `undefined` (assuming `formatCalEvent` doesn't magically add it), and the loop that emails team members will never run. This means team members won't receive the intended add-guests notification for team bookings.
